{"version":1,"content":"<p>【17:52更新】今午（18日）2時許，警方接獲報案，指一對男女於屯門山景邨景榮樓一單位燒炭。</p><p>涉事男女年約70歲，被發現時已陷昏迷，接報到場救護員即場為兩人進行檢查及急救，再由救護車送往屯門醫院，兩人經搶救後證實不治。</p><p>事件起因仍有待警方調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T10:18:50.823888+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:52:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:34.308284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T10:17:33.570125+00:00","content_hash":"9d30622eade24f4182dbaeacf036da4354bc4b857920f4a8c2da3e58fc327477","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}